<title>POLAND: Poligrafia plans share issue.</title>
<headline>Poligrafia plans share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish printing house Poligrafia SA plans to issue convertible bonds and between 600,000 and 900,000 shares to be exchanged for the bonds, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said the final decision would be taken at its general shareholders meeting on May 23, but did not give any further details.</p>
<p>Poligrafia currently has 3.6 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
